/// The error of the await of a message that defers its reply with `reply.later()`: its `Reply` was dropped unanswered,
/// with the service state, the container or the message argument that held it, so no answer will come. A deferring message
/// declares `throws ReplyStopped`, its one error. `serviceStopped` is its first case, the word the runtime fails such an
/// await with.
/// @category Services
public enum ReplyStopped implements Error
	serviceStopped
end 'ReplyStopped'
